  (text "Rails: BP1 +456 (6L6GC plates; the screens and every dropper hang at the drawing's +458 V post-choke node, choke and transformer resistance omitted) · BC +430 (phase inverter) · BA +260 (both channels) · BV +350 (vibrato pair) · BL +275 (oscillator and splitter) · bias -55 V" (at 12.7 270.598 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "712a3cb5-aac8-52b0-9a58-fc2685a9feb7"))
  (text "K1 and K2 are the two shared cathode pairs the factory sheet letters C and D: both first stages (V1) sit on one 820 Ω / 25 µF, both second stages (V2) on another." (at 12.7 274.998 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "2fbd4b1a-cdec-58df-8018-6f2747bc4625"))
  (text "The vibrato oscillator V3A is drawn in full and excluded from the DC model — a running phase-shift oscillator has no static operating point. The splitter V3B and the vibrato pair V4 are modelled." (at 12.7 279.398 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "653b2b02-3c03-5095-91fd-cdce1a60917e"))
  (text "Heaters, the standby switch and the second of the two 20 µF reservoir cans are omitted here — see the sources list and the board drawing." (at 12.7 283.798 0)
